  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Refugee Handcraft Economic Empowerment in DRCongo</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Over the years since 1996 when the war started in DRCongo, the international community abandoned refugees for reasons which we do not know yet up to now. Rwandan refugees who left Rwanda during the Genocide in 1994 and others in DRC do not enjoy International Protection, forgotten by DRC Government and highly facing hostilities from local hosting communities.  Women and young girls have paid a heavy price over the years, and many are living in dire situation. The only hope is from us now.</narrative>
  </description>
